#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Take a 20-question exam on the IBM Training site to test your skills in "
"integrating quantum and high-performance computing, and receive a badge "
"through Credly."
msgstr ""
"Realiza un examen de 20 preguntas en el sitio de IBM Training para evaluar "
"tus conocimientos sobre la integración de la computación cuántica y la "
"computación de alto rendimiento, y obtén una insignia a través de Credly."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam | Integrating quantum and high-performance computing"
msgstr ""
"Examen | Integración de la computación cuántica y la computación de alto "
"rendimiento"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Exam and badge {#exam-and-badge}"
msgstr "Examen e insignia {#exam-and-badge}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![A square badge stating the name of this course, intermediate level, and "
"issued by IBM Quantum&reg;.](/learning/images/courses/integrating-quantum-"
"and-high-performance-computing/exam/badge.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Una insignia cuadrada con el nombre de este curso, nivel intermedio, y "
"emitida por IBM Quantum&reg;.](/learning/images/courses/integrating-quantum-"
"and-high-performance-computing/exam/badge.svg)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Post-course survey {#post-course-survey}"
msgstr "Encuesta posterior al curso {#post-course-survey}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Congratulations on completing the \"Integrating quantum and high-performance"
" computing\" course by IBM&reg;!\n"
msgstr ""
"¡Felicidades por completar el curso \"Integración de la computación cuántica"
" y la computación de alto rendimiento\" de IBM&reg;!\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Test your knowledge {#test-your-knowledge}"
msgstr "Pon a prueba tus conocimientos {#test-your-knowledge}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After completing the reading and activities in this course, click the button"
" below to navigate to IBM Training, where you can take the badging exam for "
"Integrating quantum and high-performance computing.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tras completar las lecturas y actividades de este curso, haz clic en el "
"botón de abajo para ir a IBM Training, donde podrás realizar el examen de "
"acreditación sobre la integración de la computación cuántica y la "
"computación de alto rendimiento.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The exam consists of 20 questions, and you must answer at least 16 correctly"
" to pass. Upon receiving a passing score, your badge will automatically be "
"sent to the email you used to register with IBM Training.\n"
msgstr ""
"El examen consta de 20 preguntas y debes responder correctamente al menos 16"
" para aprobarlo. Al obtener una puntuación aprobatoria, tu insignia se "
"enviará automáticamente al correo electrónico que usaste para registrarte en"
" IBM Training.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Make sure you're ready to take the exam. If you don't receive a passing "
"score in two attempts, the exam becomes temporarily locked.\n"
msgstr ""
"Asegúrate de estar listo para realizar el examen. Si no obtienes una "
"puntuación aprobatoria en dos intentos, el examen quedará temporalmente "
"bloqueado.\n"

