#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"NOTICE: IBM leverages the services of Credly, a third-party data processor "
"authorized by IBM and located in the United States, to assist in the "
"administration of the IBM Digital Badge program. In order to issue you an "
"IBM Digital Badge, your personal information (name, email address, and badge"
" earned) will be shared with Credly. You will receive an email notification "
"from Credly with instructions for claiming the badge. Your personal "
"information is used to issue your badge and for program reporting and "
"operational purposes. IBM may share the personal information collected with "
"IBM subsidiaries and third parties globally. It will be handled in a manner "
"consistent with IBM privacy practices. The IBM Privacy Statement can be "
"viewed [here.](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/)\n"
msgstr ""
"AVISO: IBM utiliza los servicios de Credly, un proveedor externo autorizado "
"por IBM con sede en los Estados Unidos, para asistir en la gestión del "
"programa IBM Digital Badge. Para poder emitirte una insignia digital de IBM,"
" tu información personal (nombre, dirección de correo electrónico e insignia"
" obtenida) se compartirá con Credly. Recibirás una notificación por correo "
"electrónico de Credly con instrucciones para canjear la insignia. Tu "
"información personal se utilizará para la emisión de tu insignia, así como "
"para informes del programa y fines operativos. IBM puede compartir los datos"
" personales recopilados a nivel mundial con subsidiarias de IBM y terceros. "
"Se tratarán de manera coherente con las prácticas de privacidad de IBM. "
"Puedes consultar la declaración de privacidad de IBM "
"[aquí](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/).\n"
